{"data": [{"author_id": "1084941182206128128", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:45:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120603845042782245"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 61, "start": 57, "tag": "TSM"}, {"end": 269, "start": 264, "tag": "NVDA"}, {"end": 275, "start": 270, "tag": "AVGO"}]}, "id": "2120603845042782245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 142, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Every AI narrative eventually leads back to one company: $TSM \n\nRebounding strongly toward $412 today. \n\nWhether it's Nvidia GPUs or custom hyperscaler ASICs, every single advanced AI chip has to go through TSMC's fabs and CoWoS packaging. \n\nTrue monopoly power.\n\n$NVDA $AVGO", "url": "https://x.com/MarceloAndreas4/status/2120603845042782245"}, {"author_id": "1864676073440452608", "created_at": "2026-11-12T09:15:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120807669229326567"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2120807669229326567", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 133, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM\nTSMC'nin Ekim Geliri %59,7 Arttı, AI Çiplerinde Darboğaz Paketleme Hattında\n\n10 Kasım'da TSMC Ekim gelirini açıkladı: 586,89 milyar Tayvan doları. Bu, bir yıl öncesine göre %59,7, yalnızca bir ay öncesine göre ise %14,7 artış demek. Manşet AI talebinin sürdüğünü söylüyor.", "url": "https://x.com/YatirimYapanlar/status/2120807669229326567"}, {"author_id": "1844040351029628928", "created_at": "2026-11-12T04:20:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120733434297335966"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/96080407011718…", "end": 115, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/960804070117187584/status/2120690228499505569", "start": 92, "url": "https://t.co/ekVLkWkNMH"}]}, "id": "2120733434297335966", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Cookが来るなら変わるのは設計より調達。CoWoS枠やHBMを長期契約と前払いで囲うAppleの流儀が入れば、TSMCやSK hynixは数量が読める代わりに値上げを通しにくくなる https://t.co/ekVLkWkNMH", "url": "https://x.com/ichi_1111_1111/status/2120733434297335966"}, {"author_id": "2007413849176350721", "created_at": "2026-11-11T22:37:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120647059136970808"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4haGBJdOqO", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/KostyaAI/status/2120647059136970808/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120647052094808064", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/4haGBJdOqO"}]}, "id": "2120647059136970808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The industry is obsessed with GPU compute capabilities, but the actual choke point of the AI revolution isn't just printing the silicon. It's packaging it.\n\nWe have hit the reticle limit—the physical maximum size a monolithic chip can be manufactured. To scale further, modern AI https://t.co/4haGBJdOqO", "url": "https://x.com/KostyaAI/status/2120647059136970808"}, {"author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:41:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120482067901247876"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 14, "start": 9, "tag": "SNDK"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/H12UiXxhd9", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2120482067901247876/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120481943188041728", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/H12UiXxhd9"}]}, "id": "2120482067901247876", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 554, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SanDisk ($SNDK) architecture simulations show High-Bandwidth Flash delivers an 8x CapEx reduction by running 960GB frontier models on a single GPU instead of eight HBM accelerators, though lack of key ecosystem endorsement clouds commercialization. In simulations running https://t.co/H12UiXxhd9", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2120482067901247876"}, {"author_id": "380820651", "created_at": "2026-11-12T15:56:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120908669512823172"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 19, "start": 14, "tag": "NVDA"}, {"end": 98, "start": 93, "tag": "MSFT"}, {"end": 156, "start": 151, "tag": "AAPL"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qWGIegrOq6", "end": 196, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2120908669512823172/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120908538969227264", "start": 173, "url": "https://t.co/qWGIegrOq6"}]}, "id": "2120908669512823172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2129, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不少人拿 Jobs 比，但 $NVDA 這次是立即生效、CFO 代理、沒指定接班人，結構該比的是英特爾 2024。\n第一天的股價決定不了結局：Gates 2000 年卸任，第一個交易日 $MSFT +4.1%，一年後 −50%（S&amp;P500 −9%）；Jobs 2011 年辭職，第一個交易日 $AAPL −0.7%，一年後 +76%。 https://t.co/qWGIegrOq6", "url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2120908669512823172"}, {"author_id": "2093936981642260480", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:03:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120397048641962217"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/b9B7pwwMyb", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BottleneckDaily/status/2120397048641962217/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120396926906507265", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/b9B7pwwMyb"}]}, "id": "2120397048641962217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM | TSMC\n\nEvery AI accelerator runs on two clocks: the wafer and the package. TSMC controls both, and on Oct 15 its CEO said AI demand is \"still far above our capability today to supply\" - with the back end, the packaging step, the tighter of the two.\n\nA GPU die on its own is https://t.co/b9B7pwwMyb", "url": "https://x.com/BottleneckDaily/status/2120397048641962217"}, {"author_id": "1805721575544733697", "created_at": "2026-11-12T14:08:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120881500203762035"], "id": "2120881500203762035", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Jensen running Terafab under Elon would actually be a smart move for the whole ecosystem, not just Tesla/SpaceX.\n\nRight now AI chip supply is still gated by packaging (CoWoS), HBM, substrates, and advanced-node capacity. TSMC has said demand exceeds supply and the gap stays", "url": "https://x.com/BlakeFrontier42/status/2120881500203762035"}, {"author_id": "1128909671014604801", "created_at": "2026-11-12T11:08:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120836148348010923"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NNkAJ4WBG2", "end": 197, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2120836148348010923/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120836138047066112", "start": 174, "url": "https://t.co/NNkAJ4WBG2"}]}, "id": "2120836148348010923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "웨이퍼 한 장에 3만 달러(약 4,000만 원). 그런데도 없어서 못 산다고요?\n\n세계 최대 파운드리 TSMC가 내년 1분기 2나노 웨이퍼 가격을 6~8% 추가 인상하는 방안을 검토 중이라는 외신 보도가 나왔어요. 이미 3나노 대비 30~50% 비싼데도 가격을 또 올리겠다는 건데, 놀라운 건 빅테크들이 불만을 https://t.co/NNkAJ4WBG2", "url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2120836148348010923"}, {"author_id": "49649093", "created_at": "2026-11-12T17:22:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120930290315198528"], "id": "2120930290315198528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "英伟达能够领先的根本原因一句话概括：CUDA和全栈生态是护城河；黄仁勋与台积电的长期深度伙伴关系，是把这条护城河兑现成大规模、稳定交付算力的“必要条件”。\n一、为什么TSMC很重要", "url": "https://x.com/tongchang/status/2120930290315198528"}, {"author_id": "1947303856485842944", "created_at": "2026-11-12T15:56:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120908513454997769"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/REz9pv7XJM", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NaujSeber/status/2120908513454997769/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120908508749004800", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/REz9pv7XJM"}]}, "id": "2120908513454997769", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 113, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The board's appointment of Colette Kress as Interim CEO is not a stopgap measure; it is a clinical, geopolitical maneuver. By putting the CFO at the helm, the board sends a crystal-clear message to Washington and institutional capital: the era of frictionless, aggressive https://t.co/REz9pv7XJM", "url": "https://x.com/NaujSeber/status/2120908513454997769"}, {"author_id": "413859092", "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:40:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120919607850807646"], "id": "2120919607850807646", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 दुनिया की अगली महाशक्ति वह नहीं होगी जिसके पास सबसे ज्यादा तेल होगा, बल्कि वह होगी जिसके पास सबसे उन्नत SEMICONDUCTOR CHIPS होंगी! 🌍🔥\n\nNVIDIA और Jensen Huang की चर्चा के बीच एक बड़ा सवाल है — आखिर एक छोटी-सी चिप इतनी ताकतवर कैसे हो गई कि अमेरिका, चीन, ताइवान और भारत इसके लिए", "url": "https://x.com/imaginesanjay/status/2120919607850807646"}, {"author_id": "1874887449404448769", "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:57:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120969126999105864"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "NVDA"}]}, "id": "2120969126999105864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 793, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$NVDA 不是一家孤零零的公司，它是整条AI半导体产业链的指挥中心。黄仁勋这一走，受影响的远不止一只股票。\n\n先把这条链子理清楚，跟$NVDA有关的，基本可以分成七层。", "url": "https://x.com/youngstockuser/status/2120969126999105864"}, {"author_id": "785856172209373184", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:05:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120457972992381186"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/N6VK2ulYyE", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2120457972992381186/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120457970479947777", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/N6VK2ulYyE"}]}, "id": "2120457972992381186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "☕ Ce qu’il fallait retenir hier sur l’IA et les semi-conducteurs — 10 novembre 2026 ↓\n\n1) TSMC — Capex massif et tickets Anthropic/OpenAI validés\n\nLe conseil a approuvé ~40,93 Md$ d’investissements (nœuds avancés, packaging, fabs, R&amp;D 2027) et jusqu’à 1 Md$ au total pour https://t.co/N6VK2ulYyE", "url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2120457972992381186"}, {"author_id": "859363517597708289", "created_at": "2026-11-12T03:56:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120727430516334631"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/bO1cFfBccP", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/hsinha1445/status/2120727430516334631/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120727396831911936", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/bO1cFfBccP"}]}, "id": "2120727430516334631", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 955, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "A lot of people I speak to in India don't realise the significance of the Jensen Huang affair. If anything, it shows the importance of sovereign AI.\n\nWe all know about the affair. But that is the least interesting part of this story.\n\nThis is about Chinese AI, and how the https://t.co/bO1cFfBccP", "url": "https://x.com/hsinha1445/status/2120727430516334631"}, {"author_id": "77136191", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:49:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120333181